    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "d06ed7ab-8f4d-40b9-b009-1ecf9203636d",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "the sweet tea is to die for",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122967993993",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 7271eae1-6bdd-4936-b763-b2390fb07fe7).Image",
        "Description": "47, \r\rIn all of my adventures around the globe- i have never been more offended by any type of person than I am by southern hospitality. These people smile at me, invite me to events, and offer me food and beverages?! It&apos;s disgusting... their fake countenance and twangy sickly sweet accents rot my eardrums. &quot;This sweet tea is to die for&quot;? Give me a break. And what the fuck does &quot;Y&apos;all&quot; even mean? \rGet rid of this southern belle and her obnoxious friend. \r\rI will leave you to prepare.",
